## Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Test | Smell | Effort |
|----------|------|-------|--------|
| 1 | `addAndDoNothing` | Assertion-Free | Trivial — add one assertion |
| 2 | `addSleepy` | Sleepy Test | Trivial — delete `Thread.sleep` |
| 3 | `addNullSkuManualCatch` | Exception Handling | Low — replace with `assertThrows` |
| 4 | `addConditionalLogic` | Conditional Logic | Low — flatten to explicit calls |
| 5 | `addLoadsFromFile` | Mystery Guest | Low — inline test data |
| 6 | `doEverythingAtOnce` | Eager Test | Medium — split into focused tests |
| 7 | `quantityAfterAdds` | Magic Number | Low — use named values |
| 8 | `toStringFormat` | Sensitive Equality | Low — switch to `contains` |
| 9 | `setUp` / `rng` | General Fixture | Trivial — delete unused field |
| 10 | `disabledTest` | Ignored Test | Decision — fix or remove |

Items 1–3 prevent **false-pass** scenarios and should be addressed immediately. Items 4–5 prevent **flakiness**. The remainder are maintainability improvements.
